-- WoW Forever: every class spell and talent record live Forever has (owner decision 2026-11-03: swap over to Forever now).
-- Blizzard's live hotfix cache of 2026-11-03 01:10Z (build 70707), the cache wowsims/forever (MIT,
-- https://github.com/wowsims/forever) builds from. Same-ID rows the server loads over its DB2 data and sends to clients:
--   every Spell* record of the 1,623 class spells (spell class families 3-11, and Heart of the Wild) that live changed,
--   with their live tooltips (hotfix_blob), and every live Trait* and SkillLineAbility record (talent tree moves, new talents
--   such as Oath of Light, Boundless Light, Bloom, Predatory Discipline, Unsealed Wrath; removed nodes keep live's status).
-- Racials stay ours (2026_10_27_05 is ahead of live; live's Orc Command learn rows 59880-59882 are left out). Vanilla value holds in world classic_spell_value still apply on the server.
-- Made with tools/full_forever/live_hotfix_sql.py --spells <list> --whole-tables Trait*,SkillLineAbility --max-push 1000000.
-- Covers the records of 2026_10_30_21 and 2026_11_03_40 again (same live rows). hotfix_data ids 2010000-2019999. Safe to run again.
